# Load Testing Results - January 25, 2026

**Test Date:** January 25, 2026
**Tool:** Apache JMeter

## Test Scenario

Simulate 1,000 concurrent users accessing the MedSync Platform.

## Results

| Metric | Result |
|---|---|
| Average Response Time | 450ms |
| 95th Percentile Response Time | 850ms |
| Error Rate | 0.1% |
| Throughput | 2,500 requests/second |

## Analysis

- The platform performed well under load, with low error rates and acceptable response times.
- The 95th percentile response time is slightly above our target of 800ms, indicating some room for optimization.

## Recommendations

- Optimize slow database queries
- Increase caching for frequently accessed data
